<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 93 0 R/Alt(Measured efficiency S against (a) C, (b) Tprop, (c) measured FER and (d) L, with Equation 1 (theoretical) and Equation 2 (corrected). Colour marks the test condition; solid lines show Equation 2 and dashed lines Equation 1. Error bars show the standard deviation of the repetitions, and the shaded band in (a) marks the rates where a frame cycle exceeds the 4 s timer. In (c), whose y-axis starts at 0.25, both series share the purple model curves; in (d), the BER curves use the FER predicted by Equation 1, and the BER points are shifted right by 6% for legibility.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[49]/Pg 311 0 R>>
